# Cloud Almanac

A lightweight console for comparing the major cloud providers — AWS, Microsoft Azure, Google Cloud, Tencent Cloud and Alibaba Cloud.

## Modules

| Group | Module | Status |
|---|---|---|
| Coverage | Infrastructure — regions, AZs, edge nodes | Coming soon |
| Coverage | Features — service comparison & equivalence | Coming soon |
| Commercial | Price — per-service price comparison | In progress |
| Commercial | Support — support plans & SLAs | Coming soon |
| Commercial | Free Tier — free offers compared | Coming soon |
| Commercial | Promotions — live promotions | Coming soon |
| Trust | Certifications — compliance certifications | Coming soon |

## Stack

Plain HTML, CSS and JavaScript. No build step, no dependencies.

- `index.html` — app shell
- `styles.css` — design tokens (light / dark) and components
- `app.js` — navigation, routing (`#/module`) and theme toggle
- `data/` — comparison datasets
- `assets/` — logo and static assets

## Run locally

```sh
python3 -m http.server 8000
# open http://localhost:8000
```

## Design

- Theme: "Slate" — neutral cool grays with a steel-blue accent
- Light and dark modes, following the system preference by default
- All text meets WCAG AA; body and secondary text target ≥ 7:1
